{
  "id": "typescript-16-legacy-decorators",
  "slug": "legacy-decorators",
  "title": "Legacy (experimental) decorators and migration",
  "moduleId": "typescript-16-decorators-and-metadata",
  "order": 2,
  "hook": "**Legacy decorators** need `experimentalDecorators: true` — 3-arg `(target, key, descriptor)`. Angular, NestJS, class-validator still use them.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "What is this?",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "**experimentalDecorators** enables pre-standard API. Method decorator mutates **PropertyDescriptor**. **Parameter decorators** legacy-only for DI. **emitDecoratorMetadata** + **reflect-metadata** for design:paramtypes. **useDefineForClassFields: false** often required for Angular @Input."
        },
        {
          "type": "glossary",
          "title": "Key terms",
          "entries": [
            {
              "term": "experimentalDecorators",
              "longForm": "legacy flag",
              "plainDefinition": "Old decorator implementation.",
              "example": "true in tsconfig"
            },
            {
              "term": "PropertyDescriptor",
              "longForm": "method descriptor",
              "plainDefinition": "value/writable/enumerable/configurable.",
              "example": "descriptor.value = wrapped"
            },
            {
              "term": "parameter decorator",
              "longForm": "@Param()",
              "plainDefinition": "Records param index — DI.",
              "example": "Nest @Body()"
            },
            {
              "term": "emitDecoratorMetadata",
              "longForm": "design:type emit",
              "plainDefinition": "Emits metadata for reflect-metadata.",
              "example": "true with legacy"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Why does it matter?",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Production Angular/Nest on legacy today. Wrong tsconfig breaks DI. parameter decorators not in stage 3 yet."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "variant": "tip",
          "title": "Interview trap: parameter decorators stage 3",
          "body": "Stage 3 has no parameter decorators — Nest DI relies on legacy."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "How it works step by step",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "steps",
          "title": "Mental model",
          "items": [
            {
              "title": "experimentalDecorators true",
              "body": "Enable legacy decorator emit in tsconfig — required for Angular and NestJS projects until migration completes."
            },
            {
              "title": "emitDecoratorMetadata",
              "body": "if DI"
            },
            {
              "title": "import reflect-metadata",
              "body": "entry"
            },
            {
              "title": "plan migration",
              "body": "framework version"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "diagram": {
            "type": "mermaid",
            "title": "Legacy method dec",
            "source": "flowchart LR\n  M[@Log] --> D[descriptor.value]\n  D --> W[wrapped fn]"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Code walkthrough",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "snippet",
          "snippet": {
            "language": "typescript",
            "label": "Legacy method",
            "code": "function Log(_t: object, key: string | symbol, d: PropertyDescriptor) {\n  const orig = d.value as (...a: unknown[]) => unknown;\n  d.value = function (...a: unknown[]) { console.log(String(key)); return orig.apply(this, a); };\n}\nclass G { @Log greet() { return \"hi\"; } }",
            "explanation": "3-arg descriptor mutation."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "snippet",
          "snippet": {
            "language": "typescript",
            "label": "Parameter decorator",
            "code": "function Inject(token: string) {\n  return (target: object, _k: string | symbol | undefined, idx: number) => { /* register idx→token */ };\n}\nclass S { constructor(@Inject(\"CFG\") private c: unknown) {} }",
            "explanation": "DI parameter index."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "snippet",
          "snippet": {
            "language": "json",
            "label": "Angular tsconfig",
            "code": "{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"experimentalDecorators\": true,\n    \"emitDecoratorMetadata\": true,\n    \"useDefineForClassFields\": false\n  }\n}",
            "explanation": "Angular field decorator compat."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "snippet",
          "snippet": {
            "language": "typescript",
            "label": "Failure: stage3 in legacy project",
            "code": "// experimentalDecorators true — stage 3 signature fails",
            "explanation": "One mode per project."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
